OL,3,GNEWSAHopes new #9.9m unit will cut A&E
OL,4,Awaiting times
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been approved for a new
OL,7,F#9.9m unit which hospital bosses hope
OL,8,Fwill take pressure off their main
OL,9,Femergency department.
OL,11,FThe James Paget University Hospital
OL,12,F(JPUH) in Gorleston in Norfolk applied
OL,13,Ffor permission to build an urgent
OL,14,Ftreatment centre as it said a growing
OL,15,Fnumber of patients were attending its
OL,16,FA&E.
OL,18,FWhen it submitted proposals in June,
OL,19,Fthe hospital said the unit would mean
OL,20,Fpeople with emergency conditions that
OL,21,Fare not life-threatening could be seen
OL,22,Ffaster.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
